1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
We've only got three days left until the school festival.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Were you actually listening in second period?

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,800
Sorry, I was spacing out and didn't notice.

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,600
Will you help me get ready for the festival?

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,500
I might be late today, actually.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
Two cannons for the display stood in a row in the schoolyard.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,300
I finally understood what the teacher meant.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
I'll paint the festival sign, okay?

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,600
Let's all decide on the colour of the sign together.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,400
Before I knew it, it was already dark outside.

